      "parent": null,
      "derived_from": null,
      "move": "self_disclosure",
      "target": null,
      "text": "That reminds me that I learned my first three guitar chords from an older cousin on a terrible cheap guitar.",
      "at": "2026-08-17T11:57:23.581370Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "d-20260817T115829-mara-v2",
      "speaker": "mara",
      "parent": null,
      "derived_from": "d-20260817T115723-jules-v2",
      "move": "new_root",
      "target": null,
      "text": "I had a best friend move away when I was thirteen and we wrote letters until we slowly stopped.",
      "at": "2026-08-17T11:58:29.544856Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "d-20260817T115929-jules-v2",
      "speaker": "jules",
      "parent": "d-20260817T115829-mara-v2",
      "derived_from": null,
      "move": "follow_up",
      "target": "mara",
      "text": "How did you two know each other?",
